        "created_at": "2020-03-05T23:55:38.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Density Control is a Self-Control power, it's only usable on yourself.&nbsp; If it's done with a doodad, a Technology power would be fine.&nbsp; Otherwise I'd actually go with Cosmic Energy (\"The primal energies of the universe are yours to command\").&nbsp; And the effect would be a mass hinder.</p>",
