        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/4491bb/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2020-03-06T00:01:37.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Cosmic is a thought I hadn't had yet, and I'll definitely take a look at it.</p>\n<p>The usage I was thinking of involved the Sorcerer's Cords Of Magic:</p>\n<p>- Destroy all bonuses and penalties on a target. Then, Hinder that target using [power] using your Max die.</p>\n<p>Briefly trapping the target in a gravity well could easily be a flavor of Cords Of Magic.</p>",
