        "raw": "[quote=\"MindWanderer\"]\n\nDensity Control is a Self-Control power, it's only usable on yourself.  If it's done with a doodad, a Technology power would be fine.  Otherwise I'd actually go with Cosmic Energy (\"The primal energies of the universe are yours to command\").  And the effect would be a mass hinder.\n\n[/quote]\n\nCosmic is a great idea indeed!\nI have been playing around with a concept of macroscopic quantum state (very cliché: Scientist creates a machine that meddles with his precise positioning in space/time, let's call it the Uncertainty Generator, and takes on crimefighting to field-test its capabilities as a practical schroedinger's cat). \nRigging the Inventions power into that idea seemed a bit of a long shot, but now I think a combination of Intangibility and Cosmic Energy Manipulation should do the trick nicely. Might even throw in a very limited Teleportation at d6 or so, to cover the spatial effects.",
